@startuml pipeline-python
' Hand-maintained. Source of truth = .github/workflows/master-python-pipeline.yml + python-verify.yml + python-release.yml
title Python pipeline — same three levels, same entry-point contract

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho

package "consumer repo" as CALLER #EEEEEE {
  [.github/workflows/ci.yml] as CI <<caller>>
}

[master-python-pipeline.yml] as M <<workflow_call>> #FFFFFF

package "① build + verify — every job starts at t=0" as S1 #E8F0FE {
  [python-build.yml] as B <<compileall · reject .env>>
  package "python-verify.yml — grouping only, no steps" as V #E6F4EA {
    [python-lint.yml] as L <<ruff check · ruff format>>
    [python-unit-tests.yml] as U <<pytest -m "not integration">>
    [python-integration-tests.yml] as I <<pytest -m integration>>
    [python-security.yml] as SEC <<CodeQL · Gitleaks · Trivy>>
  }
}

[python-dependency-graph.yml] as DG <<push events only>> #E8F0FE

package "② python-release.yml — grouping only, no steps" as S2 #FEF7E0 {
  [tag.yml] as T <<shared · PRs to main>>
  [python-docker.yml] as D <<pack · scan · SBOM · sign>>
  [deploy-gitops.yml] as G <<shared · verify gate · bump manifest>>
}

[build-gate] as GATE <<if: always()>> #FFF3C4

CI --> M : uses: @<sha>\nsecrets: inherit
M --> B
M --> V
M --> DG
M --> S2

B --> DG : needs
B --> S2 : needs
V --> S2 : needs
D --> G : needs\n+ image-digest output

B ..> GATE
DG ..> GATE
V ..> GATE
S2 ..> GATE

note right of S1
  Identical shape to the Java tree:
  **verify has NO needs: build.**
  Every job checks out and installs for
  itself, so all five start at t=0.
end note

note right of SEC
  Python needs no build for SAST:
  CodeQL runs **build-mode: none**, so
  this leaf takes no python-version /
  cache-type input at all — nothing in
  it runs an interpreter.
end note

note bottom of S2
  **tag.yml and deploy-gitops.yml are the
  same files the Java pipeline calls** —
  they are language-agnostic, so there is
  no python- copy of either.

  python-docker.yml swaps Maven's
  spring-boot:build-image for the pack CLI,
  but the digest → Trivy → Syft → cosign
  chain is unchanged.
end note

footer docs/pipeline-python.puml — Bigorno12/ci-cd-templates
@enduml
